      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "MSAA often has abnormally poor performance compared even to things like just increasing render/display resolution and this makes it entirely pointless on desktop and headsets like the Quest 3 and BSB that have higher resolution. We recently updated some shaders is one of our worlds to no longer use an internal MSAA pass and this chopped the GPU time in half for almost everyone that visited. MSAA is definitely not the future of anything.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
